{"id":"30.7.2","doc":"T","title":"Clock Control in Master Mode","words":147,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The four clock modes 0 ~ 3 are supported in "},{"t":"block","v":"GP-SPI","id":"spi"},{"t":"text","v":" master mode."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The polarity and phase of GP-SPI clock are controlled by the bit "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CK_IDLE_EDGE"},{"t":"text","v":" in register "},{"t":"reg","v":"SPI_MISC_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" and the bit "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CK_OUT_EDGE"},{"t":"text","v":" in register "},{"t":"reg","v":"SPI_USER_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The register configuration for SPI clock modes 0 ~ 3 is provided in Table 30.7-1, and can be changed according to the path delay in the application."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 30.7-1. Clock Phase and Polarity Configuration in Master Mode","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Control Bit"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Mode 0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Mode 1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Mode 2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Mode 3"}]],"rows":[{"n":4,"c":[[{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CK_IDLE_EDGE"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]},{"n":5,"c":[[{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CK_OUT_EDGE"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CLK_MODE"},{"t":"text","v":" is used to select the number of rising edges of SPI_CLK, when SPI_CS raises high, to be 0, 1, 2 or SPI_CLK always on."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note:"}],"warn":true}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CLK_MODE"},{"t":"text","v":" is configured to 1 or 2, the bit "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CS_HOLD"},{"t":"text","v":" must be set and the value of "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CS_HOLD_TIME"},{"t":"text","v":" should be larger than 1."}],"warn":true}]}]}